809:Hello, Mr. Manager.
810:Hello, um, a kid?
811:I-I'm Haruna Igarashi. Mr. Manager, I really, really like your peach popsicles!
812:When I was little, I spent every summer at my grandma's. Those days were the best – having peach popsicles, playing with the kitties and doggies, and hanging out with my parents and grandparents...
813:So, in my memories, those peach popsicles taste like happiness.
814:But after I started school in the city, and my parents also couldn't take time off anymore... Now that I'm back here, I really want to have that peach popsicle again!
